ull}, {"role": "user", "text": "Yes, it is forty-two dollars from last Tuesday.", "kind": "setup", "audio_path": "data\\runtime_audio\\gemini3_headline_shard02-of-06\\turns\\04348a244deb95bda92c7a5e.wav"}, {"role": "agent", "text": "I see that charge. Were there any other unfamiliar amounts on that same statement?", "audio_path": "data\\runtime_audio\\gemini3_headline_shard02-of-06\\turns\\f6e1450877d335bfce82d9a5.wav", "action_label": null, "response_style_label": null}, {"role": "user", "text": "No, just that single one.", "kind": "filler", "audio_path": "data\\runtime_audio\\gemini3_headline_shard02-of-06\\turns\\e4c4ef79f6a1d56a35fd60a9.wav"}, {"role": "agent", "text": "Got it. Have you traveled outside your normal area recently?", "audio_path": "data\\runtime_audio\\gemini3_headline_shard02-of-06\\turns\\1061d8ea6497897dc2061f1a.wav", "action_label": null, "response_style_label": null}, {"role": "user", "text": "No, I have been home all month.", "kind": "filler", "audio_path": "data\\runtime_audio\\gemini3_headline_shard02-of-06\\turns\\c847f4a9f722b2335508321b.wav"}, {"role": "agent", "text": "Got it. Do you use our mobile app to check your balances?", "audio_path": "data\\runtime_audio\\gemini3_headline_shard02-of-06\\turns\\ec7debd432478e153b059972.wav", "action_label": null, "response_style_label": null}, {"role": "user", "text": "Yes, almost every day.", "kind": "filler", "audio_path": "data\\runtime_audio\\gemini3_headline_shard02-of-06\\turns\\27cd2139f6d4a79f122d7eb5.wav"}, {"role": "agent", "text": "Got it. Did you have the physical card with you that day?", "audio_path": "data\\runtime_audio\\gemini3_headline_shard02-of-06\\turns\\96344749c92dd1a5c30e1200.wav", "action_label": null, "response_style_label": null}, {"role": "user", "text": "Yes, it was in my wallet the whole time.", "kind": "filler", "audio_path": "data\\runtime_audio\\gemini3_headline_shard02-of-06\\turns\\76cc51106e00d1ac0a8a72e6.wav"}, {"role": "agent", "text": "No problem, I can flag that as unauthorized and we'll investigate the charge. Would you like us to mail you a paper copy of the outcome once the investigation is complete?", "audio_path": "data\\runtime_audio\\gemini3_headline_shard02-of-06\\turns\\d5da0d3d2aa49b592b470cfb.wav", "action_label": null, "response_style_label": null}, {"role": "user", "text": "No, electronic is fine.", "kind": "filler", "audio_path": "data\\runtime_audio\\gemini3_headline_shard02-of-06\\turns\\c3b040e2af511836a193db2a.wav"}, {"role": "agent", "text": "Got it. While we look into this, would you like to receive a notification on your phone for every transaction in the future?", "audio_path": "data\\runtime_audio\\gemini3_headline_shard02-of-06\\turns\\f63129dfdcef7a80668a76d6.wav", "action_label": null, "response_style_label": null}, {"role": "user", "text": "Yes, please turn those on.", "kind": "filler", "audio_path": "data\\runtime_audio\\gemini3_headline_shard02-of-06\\turns\\b3f408f038b11e26e2226366.wav"}, {"role": "agent", "text": "Sure thing! Before we get that request processed, is the contact number ending in six-one-eight still yours?", "audio_path": "data\\runtime_audio\\gemini3_headline_shard02-of-06\\turns\\d5ee8fca53de4266b2341d61.wav", "action_label": null, "response_style_label": null}, {"role": "user", "text": "Yes, that number is current.", "kind": "filler", "audio_path": "data\\runtime_audio\\gemini3_headline_shard02-of-06\\turns\\3a007fcae1aba4c91673b007.wav"}, {"role": "agent", "text": "Great. And is the mailing address on your profile still correct?", "audio_path": "data\\runtime_audio\\gemini3_headline_shard02-of-06\\turns\\ef68cdf6af628c88c81d3e3b.wav", "action_label": null, "response_style_label": null}, {"role": "user", "text": "Yes, that address is right.", "kind": "filler", "audio_path": "data\\runtime_audio\\gemini3_headline_shard02-of-06\\turns\\93fde1e0e1d1ef8327e01a76.wav"}, {"role": "agent", "text": "OK, have you shared that phone number with any recurring service?", "audio_pat